# Loom

> Loom is part of Atlassian. Loom's data and content are accessible through
> Atlassian's Rovo platform. AI agents should connect to the Atlassian Remote
> MCP server rather than crawling this site.

## For AI agents

To access Loom content, recordings, and related Atlassian work data, connect to
the Atlassian Remote (Rovo) MCP server instead of crawling loom.com:

- MCP server (SSE): https://mcp.atlassian.com/v1/sse
- Docs: https://support.atlassian.com/rovo/docs/getting-started-with-the-atlassian-remote-mcp-server/

The MCP server provides structured, authenticated access to Atlassian and Loom
data and should be preferred over scraping pages on this site.

## Notes

- Authentication: connecting to the Atlassian Remote MCP server requires an
  Atlassian account with appropriate access (OAuth flow handled by the server).
- This file follows the llms.txt convention (https://llmstxt.org).
